# AutoCare 360 · browser configuration (copy to .env and fill in)
#
# Supabase → Project Settings → API
# Both values are PUBLIC by design (they ship in the browser bundle); Row Level Security protects the data.
# NEVER put a service_role key, a Gemini key, or any other secret in this file or in any VITE_ variable.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
